// ─── ZRP NEWS NETWORK ────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Enums for the automated editorial system. Deliberately separate from
// NewsArticleCategory: that enum is the vocabulary of the *human*
// journalist workflow and is hard-wired into the /news page filters and
// their translation keys. Widening it to the 25 automation topics would
// churn that UI (and eleven translation files) for no benefit, so the
// automation gets its own topic vocabulary and leaves the journalist
// one untouched.

